<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-MIM sees A$120 mln land claim.</title>
<headline>RTRS-MIM sees A$120 mln land claim.</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>MIM Holdings Ltd said on Thursday it and Savage Resources Ltd, its partner in the Ernest Henry base metals project, expect to have an aboriginal native title claim lodged against the project in the state of Queensland.</p>
<p>MIM said the aboriginal group's representative has proposed that the partners pay about A$120 million as compensation.</p>
</text>
